Subject: JV TS-2026-009 — Helios redline response

Helios has come back with redlines to v2. Main asks:

  1. Economic split: they want 50/50. We counter-proposed 55/45.
  2. Board: they want 5 seats with tie-breaker chair rotating.
  3. IP: they are insisting on joint ownership of foreground IP.

We have moved the split to 55/45 in the v3 draft. Board at 5 seats
with rotating chair is acceptable to our MD. IP joint ownership
accepted for foreground; we retain first refusal on licensing.

Target execution: 2026-04-15. GC sign-off needed 12 hours before.

